module

public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Held.LocalPairs.PairCoverage.IntervalNormalizer.Inner.Reduction

/-!
# Inner Held interval normalizers

The shared reductions separate containment of an inner normalizer in a
literal local overgroup from its image in that overgroup's two-core quotient.
The concrete ambient containment and local quotient calculations are still
required; this module does not assert the completed interval calculation.

Sources: Aschbacher–Smith, printed pp.509–511 and 747–748; GLS3, Table 5.3p.
-/
